name: aml_account_transfers
description: "Account-to-account money movement from the aml_txn feed (payer to payee; cash has no payee). Open it, seed with an account an Alert named, then run Cycles, Shortest path or a money pattern pack. To watch structuring over the whole Dataset create an Investigation over aml_txn and bind a structuring value Measure Alert Rule (runbook)."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: dagre
profile: finance
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: aml_txn
    sourceCol: account_id
    targetCol: counterparty_id
    linkKindCol: txn_type
    attrCols[2]: txn_ts,amount
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
